{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01559","headline":"琴曲歌辞  秋思二首 一 · 李白","name":"琴曲歌辞  秋思二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春阳如昨日，碧树鸣黄鹂。\n芜然蕙草暮，飒尔凉风吹。\n天秋木叶下，月冷莎鸡悲。\n坐愁羣芳歇，白露凋华滋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}